# Route: guide 29 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to
# 50, 54 quests, 4.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, The Hinterlands, Westfall): Booty Bay -> Venture
# Co. Base Camp -> Booty Bay -> The Vile Reef -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore ->
# Ruins of Aboraz -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore ->
# Ruins of Zul'Mamwe -> Mistvale Valley -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (620;
# Mok'rash 50); The Captain's Chest (8551; Gorlash 47); The Captain's Chest
# (614; Gorlash 47); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); The Monogrammed Sash
# (8552; Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (8554; Negolash 52); The Super Snapper
# FX (2944; Gammerita 48).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), The Defias Brotherhood
# (166), The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373).

